Per-run diagnostics
These per-run images are saved by Process8Peak.R when each run is processed, so the page stays light. The bead gate should land on the dense scatter cluster (red, not the debris); the 2D cluster view should show 8 tight, ordered, single-coloured blobs along the diagonal.

Bead gate (FSC-A × SSC-A)

Code
gate_imgs &lt;- sort(list.files("images/8peak_evo", pattern = "^gate_.*[.]png$", full.names = TRUE))
if (length(gate_imgs) == 0) {
  cat("_No saved gate images yet — run `Process8Peak.R`._\n\n")
} else {
  cat("::: {layout-ncol=3}\n")
  for (f in gate_imgs) {
    d &lt;- sub("^gate_(.*)[.]png$", "\\1", basename(f))
    cat(sprintf("![Run %s](../%s)\n\n", d, f))   # ../ : path is relative to the page in pages/
  }
  cat(":::\n")
}







